{"script":"yd_005_04","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1c","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":280,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-297,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1c","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":280,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-297,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]你或许……听过一些我的传闻，就是些好事的客人总说我……态度冷淡什么的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]说我只会板着个脸，连服务客人的时候都一副拒人千里之外的态度……我有些好奇，你也是这么想的吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]你说我……其实没那么冷淡，其实对待工作很热情的？[r]唔，竟然有这样的见解，说的我都有点害臊了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]我不是那种工作狂，最大的心愿也只是“不再加班”……但交给我的工作，我也会尽心尽力完成。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]但驿站人手不足，异变来势汹汹，加班也是没办法的事。可能最近实在是太疲劳了，才让客人们看到我提不起劲的一面吧……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"茜塔-熟识1"}